{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_066_spatial_transformer_network-title\">Spatial Transformer Network</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">定位网络预测变换参数，grid generator 与可微 sampler 将任务梯度传回几何坐标。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Predicts geometric transformation parameters θ via a localization network, generates a transformed sampling grid, and warps feature maps via a differentiable sampler.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">输入特征图/图像 U</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Input image or feature map U</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">按学习变换重采样后的 V</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Spatially warped feature map V resampled over learned coordinates T_θ(G)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2015/hash/33ceb07bf4eeb3da587e268d663aba1a-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Spatial Transformer Network original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/098c6725bae0921f58aa.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 U</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input U</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">图像或中间特征图</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests input image or feature map u and prepares initial tensor representations (input U).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"图像或中间特征图\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests input image or feature map u and prepares initial tensor representations (input U).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入 U\" data-node-name-en=\"input U\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 U</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input U</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像或中间特征图</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests input image or feature map u and prepares initial tensor representations (input U).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CNN/MLP 从 U 预测变换参数\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Localization Network to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"定位网络\" data-node-name-en=\"Localization Network\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">定位网络</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Localization Network</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CNN/MLP 从 U 预测变换参数</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Localization Network to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仿射、TPS 等低维几何参数\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs theta within the core differentiable coordinate warp computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"参数 theta\" data-node-name-en=\"theta\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">参数 theta</span><span class=\"lang-en\">theta</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仿射、TPS 等低维几何参数</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs theta within the core differentiable coordinate warp computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对每个输出坐标计算其输入采样位置 T_theta(G)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Grid Generator within the core differentiable coordinate warp computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"网格生成器\" data-node-name-en=\"Grid Generator\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">网格生成器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Grid Generator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对每个输出坐标计算其输入采样位置 T_theta(G)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Grid Generator within the core differentiable coordinate warp computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"双线性插值；梯度可传至输入与 theta\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Differentiable Sampler within the core differentiable coordinate warp computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"可微采样器\" data-node-name-en=\"Differentiable Sampler\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可微采样器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Differentiable Sampler</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">双线性插值；梯度可传至输入与 theta</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Differentiable Sampler within the core differentiable coordinate warp computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与下游网络尺寸约定一致的重采样结果\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"变换后 V\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">变换后 V</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与下游网络尺寸约定一致的重采样结果</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"分类/配准等任务损失反传到定位网络\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces spatially warped feature map v resampled over learned coordinates t_θ(g) via loss.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"下游损失\" data-node-name-en=\"loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_066_spatial_transformer_network', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">分类/配准等任务损失反传到定位网络</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces spatially warped feature map v resampled over learned coordinates t_θ(g) via loss.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"