><use x=\"118.289302\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g10-66\" y=\"-52.632629\"></use><use x=\"117.959553\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g10-56\" y=\"-45.670122\"></use><use x=\"124.481285\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-0\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"133.101125\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g13-60\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"141.111077\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-106\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"143.502108\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-186\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"148.978184\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g17-109\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"156.729116\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g17-97\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"161.152531\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g17-120\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"166.631985\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-185\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"170.348046\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g17-48\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"175.329366\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g13-150\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"179.59\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g17-49\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"186.785186\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-0\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"195.733793\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-106\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"198.523329\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g13-72\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"203.470778\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g10-66\" y=\"-52.632629\"></use><use x=\"203.345249\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g10-56\" y=\"-45.670122\"></use><use x=\"209.66276\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-0\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"218.262676\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g13-61\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"223.772011\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-106\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use><use x=\"226.163043\" xlink:href=\"#m066_g7-186\" y=\"-48.518069\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">普通 CNN 无法对采样坐标和几何变换端到端求导</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Standard CNN pooling offered only tiny local translation invariance and could not differentiate through spatial coordinate warping.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用 localization network、grid generator 与可微 sampler 学习空间变换</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Formulate coordinate transformation and sub-pixel bilinear/trilinear interpolation as an explicit, sub-differentiable neural module.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把重采样写成可微算子，使下游 loss 可反传到变换参数</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Sub-gradients with respect to sampling grid coordinates allow upstream networks to learn affine, projective, or thin-plate-spline warps end-to-end.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为 VoxelMorph、可微配准和 2D/3D warping 的算子基础</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Provides the foundational differentiable warping operator (`grid_sample`) underlying VoxelMorph and all modern learned medical registration.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">基础设施；本身不保证变换平滑、可逆或物理合理</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Essential differentiable geometry primitive; requires explicit regularization when generalized from low-DOF affine to dense displacement fields.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">将坐标变换与插值写成可微模块，使几何参数能由最终任务损失端到端学习。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">采用 inverse sampling：逐输出位置查询输入，可避免 forward splat 的空洞。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">STN 只提供可微 warping，不自动保证变换平滑、可逆、无 folding 或符合解剖。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Formulate coordinate transformation and sub-pixel bilinear/trilinear interpolation as an explicit, sub-differentiable neural module.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Sub-gradients with respect to sampling grid coordinates allow upstream networks to learn affine, projective, or thin-plate-spline warps end-to-end.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Differentiable Coordinate Grid Generation &amp; Bilinear/Trilinear Image Sampling.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">是 VoxelMorph、可微配准、ROI 对齐和 2D/3D warping 的基础算子。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">医学形变需要另加平滑、Jacobian、边界或拓扑约束；仅靠下游分类损失可能学到非物理裁剪。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Provides the foundational differentiable warping operator (`grid_sample`) underlying VoxelMorph and all modern learned medical registration.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Essential differentiable geometry primitive; requires explicit regularization when generalized from low-DOF affine to dense displacement fields.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2015/hash/33ceb07bf4eeb3da587e268d663aba1a-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Spatial Transformer Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
